   "t": 0,
   "text": "Nobody speaks for the first five minutes. Including you.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "A normal game on a pitch with small goals, played in silence.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 2.22,
   "text": "With no shouting, they have to look up and read each other.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 8.33,
   "text": "The give and go gets read off the shoulder, and support still arrives on time.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 13.89,
   "text": "Then let the noise back in, or go silent throughout with hand signals only.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "progression"
  },
  {
